  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SweFOR 2018-2022 - SweFOR 2018-2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SweFOR/Kristna Fredsr&#xf6;relsen Colombia 2018-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projektst&#xf6;d till Kristina Fredsr&#xf6;relsens skyddsprogram syftar till att influera s&#xe4;kerhetsriskerna f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare genom att: (i) Minska hoten; (ii) Minska s&#xe5;rbarheten; och (iii) &#xd6;ka kapaciteten genom f&#xf6;ljande fyra arbetsomr&#xe5;den:

1) Fysisk ledsagning av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheters f&#xf6;rsvarare.
2) &#xd6;ka graden av engagemang hos nyckelakt&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r skyddet av f&#xf6;rsvarare.
3) St&#xe4;rka sj&#xe4;lvskyddssystemen och kulturen f&#xf6;r icke-v&#xe5;ldsamt och differentierat sj&#xe4;lvskydd.
4) &#xd6;ka Kristna Freds institutionella kapacitet f&#xf6;r arbete i Colombia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project support to SweFOR&#x2019;s protection programme aims to influence the security risks of human rights defenders by: (i) Reducing threats; (ii) Reducing vulnerability; and (iii) Increasing capacity, through the following four working areas:

1) Physical accompaniment to human rights defenders.
2) Increasing the level of commitment of key stakeholders in the protection of defenders.
3) Strengthen self-protection systems and the culture of non-violent and differentiated self-protection.
4) Increasing SweFOR Colombia&#x2019;s institutional capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, SweFOR will help strengthen the protection of human rights defenders and social leaders and expand their scope of action. In this way, they will be able to demand greater guarantees in the defense of their rights.</narrative>
  </description>
